Get the latest price and market updates for Romell Shraddha.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n## Romell Shraddha Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 431 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Romell Shraddha, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.06 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 706 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Romell Shraddha, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/romell-shraddha-apartment-2-bhk-706sqft-20234002154008.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.73 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 943 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Romell Shraddha, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/romell-shraddha-apartment-3-bhk-943sqft-20233802153835.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.31 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Romell Shraddha\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Romell Shraddha, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Romell Shraddha in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Romell Shraddha in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Romell Shraddha in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ashish Mhatre  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Romell Shraddha in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK + Store Room Apartment For Sale in Romell Shraddha in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Space Realty Plus  profile picture]()\n![1 BHK Apartment For Rent in Romell Shraddha in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![suresh A Tayade  profile picture]()\n![Suresh A Tayade]()\n\nSuresh Properties And Consultant\n\n![Sunil Ransure]()\n\nClassic Property\n\n![Smita Shah]()\n\nEst8 Lab\n\n![Ashish Mhatre]()\n\nMake My Home Estate\n\n![Space Realty Plus]()\n\nSpace Realty Plus\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Romell Shraddha\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Romell Shraddha to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Romell Shraddha Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/romell-shraddha-project-floor-plans1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Romell Shraddha\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Romell Group Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Romell Shraddha.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Romell Shraddha](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/romell-shraddha-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Stfrancis Dassisi High School\n\n#### Mtpoinsur Church\n\n#### Chandra Maternity Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Romell Shraddha\n\n## How does Romell Shraddha compare with similar projects?\n\n![Romell Shraddha project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-shraddha-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Romell Shraddha](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/romell-shraddha/27854/project \"Romell Shraddha\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Chandak Nishchay project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-chandak-nishchay-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Chandak Nishchay](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-nishchay/10108/project \"Chandak Nishchay\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Paradigm Ananda Park project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-paradigm-ananda-park-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Paradigm Ananda Park](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-ananda-park/157970/project \"Paradigm Ananda Park\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Romell Group Track Record\n\n![Romell Group logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/romell-group-1331.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nRomell Group is one of Mumbai’s biggest realty players, starting its journey from 1982 onwards. Vile East Road is where its corporate office is situated while the portfolio of Romell Group projects covers several landmark residential projects across diverse locations. Affordable homes are offered to buyers along with premium luxury apartments here. Several iconic buildings have been built over the years with key emphasis on strategic locations, premium amenities, unmatched quality, aesthetic appeal and overall convenience. Several properties are also being built at present by the Group. Designs draw deeply from contemporary elegance in tandem with spirituality. Architectural innovation drives all development coupled with seamless construction management. There is a skilled workforce that attends to virtually any need along with serving customers impeccably. Superb planning, reliability, stringent quality standards, well connected areas, transparency in business dealings, integrity are core values that are religiously adhered to. Major offerings include Diva, Umiya Grandeur, Aether, etc.\n\n![Romell Espalier residential project in Vile Parle East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-espalier-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVile Parle East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.02 Cr to 5.85 Cr\n\n![Romell Ariana residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-ariana-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.24 Cr to 2.37 Cr\n\n![Romell Asrava residential project in Andheri West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-asrava-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.73 Cr to 3.66 Cr\n\n![Romell Empress Phase II residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-empress-phase-ii-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.54 Cr to 1.62 Cr\n\n![Romell Bliss residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-bliss-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri East, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Romell Serene residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-serene-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.16 Cr to 3.16 Cr\n\n![Romel