j Reserve Wing 2308 units](/maharera-project/godrej-reserve-wing-2/P51800079457)[Westwood305 units](/maharera-project/westwood/P51800034338)[Laxmi Nagar304 units](/maharera-project/laxmi-nagar/P51800010918)\n\n?\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhen is possession of Shraddha Paradise?\n\nAs per MahaRERA, proposed possession is Dec 2028.\n\nIs Shraddha Paradise RERA-registered?\n\nYes — MahaRERA registration P51800052244, registered 2023-08-02. The current MahaRERA source record reports no litigations.\n\nWhat configurations and prices are available?\n\n2 configuration(s), including 2 BHK of 606 sqft at ₹1.75 Cr. See the pricing table above.\n\nWho is the developer?\n\nShraddha Prime Projects — 19 projects tracked on Mumbai Property Exchange. [View their track record ▸](/builder/shraddha-prime-projects-limited)\n\nHow do I book or get more details?\n\nTap WhatsApp or Call below to speak with a Mumbai Property Exchange advisor — serving Mumbai since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017.\n\nSOURCE · MAHARERA + MUMBAI PROPERTY EXCHANGE  \nINDEPENDENT DATA · RERA A51800043517 · EST. 1995\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Shraddha%20Paradise%20(RERA%20P51800052244))[Enquire ▸](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Shraddha%20Paradise%20(RERA%20P51800052244))\n\n🎯 AI Matchmaker\n\nTell us what you want in Borivali — get matched\n\nRERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.\n\n[New launch\n\nCodename Capital World, Thane West\n\nNew launch in Thane West — ₹14,382/sq.ft\n\nView project ›](/ad-click/900040)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/project-romell-shraddha-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs","title":"1 Flats for Sale in Romell Shraddha, Mumbai - Flats Price in Romell Shraddha","raw_content":"# Flats for Sale in Romell Shraddha, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Buy 1 BHK Resale Flat in  Romell Shraddha Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVN99s9ds8ch7z3s6r06sFf01_2lj7M/Photo_h180_w240/84819753_3_PropertyImage629-2148426910585_180_240.jpg \"Buy 1 BHK Resale Flat in  Romell Shraddha Mumbai\")\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Romell Shraddha, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nWelcome to this meticulously designed apartment located in one of the most soughtafter pockets of mumbai. Perfectly blending modern architecture with functional living, this property offers an unparalleled urban lifestyle for families, working professionals, and astute investors alike.  Nearby Landmark: St. Francis Play Ground, IC Church, Borivali West.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/1-BHK-620-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834383139